shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [291.3731689453125, 325.064453125], "pos": [1582.15673828125, 1656.85693359375], "widgets_values": ["{\n  \"geci\": \"[Verse 1]\\nBlue sweater wrapped around my shoulders, \\nSoft sunlight kisses my hair, \\nYou're not here, but I feel you near, \\nIn the quiet, I'm still dreaming of you.\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nI'm lost in your eyes, your gentle gaze, \\nYour love is my sanctuary, my safe place, \\nEven when you're not near, I still believe, \\nThat you're always with me, in every dream I see.\\n\\n[Verse 2]\\nThe wind whispers through the trees, \\nI'm alone, but not in pain, \\nI'm holding on to memories, \\nOf the moments we shared, so sweet and true.\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nI'm lost in your eyes, your gentle gaze, \\nYour love is my sanctuary, my safe place, \\nEven when you're not near, I still believe, \\nThat you're always with me, in every dream I see.\\n\\n[Bridge]\\nIf you're gone, I'll find you in the stars, \\nIn the moonlight, in the morning air, \\nI'll carry you with me, through the years, \\nUntil the day we're reunited, once more.\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nI'm lost in your eyes, your gentle gaze, \\nYour love is my sanctuary, my safe place, \\nEven when you're not near, I still believe, \\nThat you're always with me, in every dream I see.\\n\\n[Outro]\\nI'll wait for you, in the blue of the sky, \\nIn the silence, in the quiet, I'll be, \\nUntil the day we meet again, \\nIn the light, in the love, in the way we were.\",\n  \"style\": \"Female Vocals, breathy tone, 90s adult contemporary soft pop ballad, dreamy romantic atmosphere, warm rhodes piano, lush synth string pads, gentle acoustic guitar, big reverb and delay, heartfelt and slightly cheesy 90s radio love song feel, 100 bpm, smooth flowing eighth-note groove, emotional soaring chorus, tender and desperate tone, soft sunlight, gentle breeze, beachside setting, contemplative mood\"\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "t